@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : Request to save a map
    activate System


    System --> Editor : Prompt to select a map
    deactivate System


    Editor -> System : Selects a map
    activate System


    System --> Editor: Display success message: "Map saved."
    deactivate System
    deactivate Editor



@enduml